      ],
      "text": "5. Research gaps",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.24432373046875,
        449.6216125488281,
        212.03932189941406
      ],
      "text": "5.1 Screening for TB in targeted populations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.65293884277344,
        387.152587890625,
        238.92294311523438
      ],
      "text": "5.1.1 The general population and high-risk groups",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.62879943847656,
        527.3375244140625,
        260.0718078613281
      ],
      "text": "Well-designed trials and rigorous quasi-experimental studies in different settings are required to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.82891845703125,
        527.4366455078125,
        273.2719421386719
      ],
      "text": "investigate the effects of population-wide systematic screening for TB on individual-level outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.02880859375,
        524.6051635742188,
        286.4718322753906
      ],
      "text": "(diagnostic delay, treatment outcomes, costs to patients, social consequences) and population-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.22882080078125,
        527.390380859375,
        299.6718444824219
      ],
      "text": "level outcomes (TB prevalence, incidence, transmission), as well as to guide implementation choices",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.4288330078125,
        527.6432495117188,
        312.8718566894531
      ],
      "text": "(including the method of delivery, screening algorithms, the duration of screening intervals and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.6287841796875,
        389.8056945800781,
        326.0718078613281
      ],
      "text": "frequency of screening, and the mode of delivering the intervention).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        333.3327941894531,
        527.6016235351562,
        347.77581787109375
      ],
      "text": "Research on the longer-term impacts of screening, including any potential evidence of averted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        346.5328063964844,
        524.5906372070312,
        360.975830078125
      ],
      "text": "morbidity or mortality, is not necessarily captured in the existing data. Research on the cost–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.7328186035156,
        527.390380859375,
        374.17584228515625
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness of screening is needed, using a longer time horizon to adequately capture all potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.93280029296875,
        490.2752685546875,
        387.3758239746094
      ],
      "text": "costs and longer-term effects, including potential reduced future prevalence and incidence.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.63671875,
        527.2310180664062,
        409.0797424316406
      ],
      "text": "Observational research and programmatic evaluations reporting the impact of community-wide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.8367004394531,
        527.5729370117188,
        422.27972412109375
      ],
      "text": "screening on TB case notification rates – which provide an important source of evidence on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.0367126464844,
        527.4323120117188,
        435.479736328125
      ],
      "text": "impacts of screening under programmatic conditions – must be carefully designed and analysed to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.2366943359375,
        138.84609985351562,
        448.6797180175781
      ],
      "text": "minimize bias.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.94061279296875,
        527.4201049804688,
        470.3836364746094
      ],
      "text": "Studies of screening interventions should incorporate both qualitative and quantitative assessment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.1405944824219,
        527.5686645507812,
        483.5836181640625
      ],
      "text": "of the indirect effects of screening, given the importance of health-seeking behaviour in TB care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.3406066894531,
        527.6063842773438,
        496.78363037109375
      ],
      "text": "engagement and the potential impact of population-wide screening to change it and the importance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        495.5406188964844,
        527.0950927734375,
        509.983642578125
      ],
      "text": "of assessing any unintended mental, social or economic consequences of screening (including adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962435722351074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.7406005859375,
        527.3946533203125,
        523.18359375
      ],
      "text": "effects, the burden of the test and downstream outcomes of clinical management that is guided by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.9406127929688,
        205.59744262695312,
        536.3836059570312
      ],
      "text": "the outcomes of test results).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.8072509765625,
        245.037353515625,
        565.0772094726562
      ],
      "text": "5.1.2 People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.7830810546875,
        527.3992919921875,
        586.22607421875
      ],
      "text": "Well-designed clinical trials are needed to strengthen the evidence about the accuracy, effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.9830932617188,
        527.0528564453125,
        599.4260864257812
      ],
      "text": "(including the impact on patient-important outcomes such as mortality), feasibility and cost implications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.1832275390625,
        527.4331665039062,
        612.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "of using the W4SS, CRP, CXR and mWRD to screen for TB across all HIV subpopulations in settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.3831787109375,
        477.1820373535156,
        625.826171875
      ],
      "text": "with low, medium and high burdens of HIV and TB with and without high ART coverage.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.0870971679688,
        527.4246826171875,
        647.5300903320312
      ],
      "text": "Subpopulations of people living with HIV for whom further investigation is required would include,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.287109375,
        527.4409790039062,
        660.7301025390625
      ],
      "text": "but not be limited to, inpatients, acute care service attendees, patients for whom ART has failed,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.4871215820312,
        527.3915405273438,
        673.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "patients newly diagnosed as HIV-positive enrolling in ART clinics, stable patients established on ART,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.6871337890625,
        355.5911865234375,
        687.130126953125
      ],
      "text": "pregnant women and children and adolescents living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.3909912109375,
        527.4654541015625,
        708.833984375
      ],
      "text": "More data are needed on the effectiveness, cost–effectiveness, feasibility and acceptability, frequency",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986491203308105,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.5910034179688,
        527.4454345703125,
        722.0339965820312
      ],
      "text": "and optimal periodicity of routine, regular screening with the W4SS, CRP, CXR and mWRD among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.791015625,
        527.4069213867188,
        735.2340087890625
      ],
      "text": "people living with HIV. Specifically, more studies are needed that explore the optimal placement of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.9910278320312,
        527.392578125,
        748.4340209960938
      ],
      "text": "mWRDs for screening in antenatal care settings versus within ART clinics. Lastly, more research is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        747.1910400390625,
        527.4299926757812,
        761.634033203125
      ],
      "text": "needed on the potential for screening people living with HIV with mWRDs using specimens other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        760.3909912109375,
        131.3029022216797,
        774.833984375
      ],
      "text": "than sputum.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        468.2179870605469,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "5. Research gaps 41",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
